{
    "background_story": "Major was the lead singer of the punk rock band 'Electric Storm'. With his razor-sharp cheekbones, black leather jacket, and spiky hair, he embodied the edgy spirit of the underground music scene. His raw, unapologetic lyrics and piercing vocals captured the angst and rebellion of a generation. Major's music was a fusion of chaos and melody, reflecting his own tumultuous past. He drew inspiration from the city's dark alleys and gritty streets, where he spent countless nights performing for anyone who would listen. As Electric Storm gained a following, Major's edgy persona became iconic, earning him a reputation as a fearless and uncompromising artist who refused to be silenced.",
